ah, yes. got hyper focused on solving one problem, kind of over looked the obvious. I'll get that update done. I have also been looking at changing:

```
from:
 emit redissectPacketsRequested();
 to:
 emit recolorPacketsRequested();
```

To stop a redissection occurring each time i pause and unpause. Just trigger the repaint.

